  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 4904.07 Request for Reactivating Status of Certificate",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4904.07 Request for Reactivating Status of Certificate.\n\n(a) The department shall return a certified person to active status upon receipt of:\n\n(1) Payment of renewal fee; and\n\n(2) Evidence of completion of current education requirements.\n\nSource. #8650, eff 6-2-06",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c4900.html"
